            "href": null,
            "math": null,
            "styles": [],
            "text": "The depot keeps three walk-in freezers at minus eighteen degrees. Each is\nchecked twice per shift, and readings go into the paper log by the door."
          }
        ],
        "type": "paragraph"
      },
