            "footnote_ref": null,
            "href": null,
            "math": null,
            "styles": [],
            "text": "Seals on freezer two were replaced in March. The technician noted frost\nbuild-up near the hinge side; the café staff were asked to keep the door shut."
          }
        ],
        "type": "paragraph"
      },
      {
        "attrs": {},
        "id": "b0005",
